<title>USA: Chattem clarifies 97 earnings forecast.</title>
<headline>Chattem clarifies 97 earnings forecast.</headline>
<dateline>CHATTANOOGA, Tenn. 1997-06-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Chattem Inc clarified on Friday its projected earnings per share for the current fiscal year ending November 30.</p>
<p>Chattem said Thursday it expected a 60 percent increase over its fiscal 1996 earnings per share.</p>
<p>The company said Friday the forecast applied to its net operating earnings of $0.47 per share, not over its net earnings of $0.40 per share, which reflected a $0.07 charge.</p>
<p>Based on the projected increase, the company said it expected to earn about $0.75 per share in the current fiscal year.</p>
</text>
